==Restrictions==
Unit Restriction: Only [[Cat Giraffe Modoki (Special Cat)|Cat Giraffe Modoki]], [[Catnip Tricky (Special Cat)|Catnip Tricky]] and [[Catnip Dragon (Special Cat)|Catnip Dragon]]

==Battleground==
*1 [[Red Wind]] (200%) spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Red Wind]] (200%) spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*1 [[Red Wind]] (200%) spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Red Wind]] (1%) spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Red Wind]]s (200%) spawn, delay 11.67~13.33 seconds<sup>350f~400f</sup>.
**2 [[Red Wind]]s (200%) spawn, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A rather easy stage, even with the restriction of only using the [[JRA Collaboration Event|JRA Collaboration]] units, the enemy serves practically no threat at all. It is recommended to increase the collaboration units to at least 1+10 or higher to deal with the mass amount of hp the enemies have.

